The  interface is a software interface that implements source‐ad‐
dress‐based routing.  Packets are directed to the interface using
normal routing decision process.  Packets queued for delivery are
then processed according to the rules established for the  inter‐
face using the utility.  To use an device, the administrator must
first  create  the interface.  This can be done by using the com‐
mand.  An call on will also create a  network  interface  with  a
unit number the same as the minor device number of that device if
the  interface  doesn’t  exist  yet.  To be useful, the interface
